      "text": "%spark\n/*we could transform our RDD using this value. In this instance, we will create a key–value\npair according to the value we might have in the map*/\n\n//transformation\n\n\nwords.map(row => (row, suppBroadcast.value.getOrElse(row,0))).collect() \n//Array[(String, Int)] = Array((Spark,1000), (The,0), (Definitive,200), (Guide,0), (:,0), (Big,-300), (Data,0), (Processing,0), (Made,0), (Simple,100))\n\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
